@startuml spresense_main_board_l1_buildingblocks
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK JP"
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title L1: Spresense メインボード Building Block View (arc42)\n各コンポーネント = 黒箱: 責務 + provides/requires インタフェース

' ==============================================================
' Spresense メインボード = white-box
' ==============================================================
frame "🔧 Spresense メインボード (white-box)\nCXD5602 / Cortex-M4F×6 @156MHz, RAM 1.5 MB" as MAIN_BOARD #LightYellow {

  component "📷 **Capture Pipeline**\n責務: ISX012 → JPEG\n実装: camera_manager.c +\n      encoder_manager.c" as C_CAPTURE
  component "🗂️ **Frame Buffer Manager**\n責務: g_empty/g_action queue 管理\n実装: frame_queue.c" as C_FBM
  component "📦 **Streaming Engine**\n責務: MJPEG batch + CRC-16\n実装: mjpeg_protocol.c +\n      protocol_handler.c" as C_STREAM
  component "🚚 **Transport Manager**\n責務: TCP/USB 切替・再接続\n実装: tcp_server.c + usb_transport.c\n      + wifi_manager.c" as C_TRANSPORT
  component "🎛️ **Adaptive Controller**\n責務: PID + 多変数適応制御\n実装: fps_controller.c +\n      frame_statistics.c +\n      enhanced_control.h" as C_CTRL
  component "📊 **Health Monitor**\n責務: 計測収集 + 58B metrics\n実装: perf_logger.c" as C_MON
  component "🧵 **Lifecycle Orchestrator**\n責務: 起動・thread spawn\n実装: camera_app_main.c +\n      camera_threads.c" as C_LIFE
}

' ==============================================================
' Interfaces (provides/requires) — 主要なもののみ
' ==============================================================

' === 主データフロー ===
() "frame_produced"  as I_FRAME_OUT
() "frame_pool"      as I_FBM_API
() "batch_packet"    as I_BATCH
() "transmit_done"   as I_TX_DONE

C_CAPTURE  -( I_FRAME_OUT
I_FRAME_OUT )- C_FBM

C_FBM      -( I_FBM_API
I_FBM_API  )- C_STREAM   : "pop"
I_FBM_API  )- C_CAPTURE  : "alloc"

C_STREAM   -( I_BATCH
I_BATCH    )- C_TRANSPORT

C_TRANSPORT -( I_TX_DONE
I_TX_DONE  )- C_FBM       : "buffer 解放"

' === 制御ループ ===
() "queue_depth"  as I_DEPTH
() "queue_resize" as I_RESIZE

C_FBM    -( I_DEPTH
I_DEPTH  )- C_CTRL

C_CTRL   -( I_RESIZE
I_RESIZE )- C_FBM

' === テレメトリ ===
() "metrics_pkt\n(58B)" as I_METRICS

C_MON       -( I_METRICS
I_METRICS   )- C_TRANSPORT

' === ライフサイクル ===
C_LIFE ..> C_CAPTURE   : "spawn camera_thread"
C_LIFE ..> C_TRANSPORT : "spawn usb/tcp_thread"

' === Health Monitor は受動的: 計測を引く (note だけ) ===
C_MON ..> C_CAPTURE   : "perf 計測読み取り"
C_MON ..> C_TRANSPORT : "TCP health 読み取り"

' ==============================================================
' External (NuttX Kernel): L1 では参照のみ
' ==============================================================
package "External: NuttX Kernel\n(L1 の対象外)" as EXT_NUTTX #LightGray {
  [V4L2 driver] as EXT_V4L2
  [USB CDC-ACM driver] as EXT_USB
  [GS2200M driver] as EXT_GS
  [pthread / scheduler] as EXT_PTHREAD
}

C_CAPTURE   ..> EXT_V4L2     : "VIDIOC_DQBUF/QBUF"
C_TRANSPORT ..> EXT_GS       : "SPI 経由 TCP send"
C_TRANSPORT ..> EXT_USB      : "USB CDC-ACM bulk"
C_LIFE      ..> EXT_PTHREAD

note bottom
  **arc42 階層位置**:
  • L1 (本図): メインボード white-box, 内部 7 ブロックを黒箱配置
  • L2 (別図): 各黒箱を white-box 化した詳細
    - L2.A spresense_main_board_l2a_capture.puml (Capture Pipeline 詳細)
    - L2.B spresense_main_board_l2b_transport.puml (Streaming + Transport 詳細)
    - L2.C spresense_main_board_l2c_control.puml (Adaptive Controller 詳細)
  • **データビュー** (別図): バッファ/キュー + メモリ予算
    spresense_main_board_data_view.puml
  • **プロセスビュー** (別図): スレッド・優先度・同期
    spresense_main_board_process_view.puml

  **C4 対応**: 本図は C4 Component diagram レベル
end note

@enduml
